\* Region Request
requestStates == {"Current watch confirmed", "Outcome unknown, retry same request", "Private watch hidden", "Reading current watch", "Waiting for confirmation", "Watch unavailable, previous confirmation labelled stale"}
\* Region Session
sessionStates == {"Sign in again", "Signed in"}
\* Region Command
commandStates == {"Exact request and key retained", "No pending request"}

